1
00:00:01,654 --> 00:00:06,554
4:07pm. Friday. — Your 3:30 just cancelled.

2
00:00:09,815 --> 00:00:15,227
One patient cancels.

3
00:00:15,227 --> 00:00:24,415
Thirty seconds of admin. That is the whole cancellation.

4
00:00:24,415 --> 00:00:27,542
The waitlist already knows who wanted that slot.

5
00:00:27,542 --> 00:00:34,223
Priority and flexibility decide who gets called — not who asked first.

6
00:00:34,223 --> 00:00:41,174
Notify marks the entry called, so nobody rings them twice.

7
00:00:41,174 --> 00:00:46,709
They accept. The entry leaves the queue.

8
00:00:46,709 --> 00:00:50,546
Their intake goes out on its own.

9
00:00:50,546 --> 00:00:54,366
Answers land on the chart before the visit, not during it.

10
00:00:54,509 --> 00:00:59,079
The slot refills itself. — Front desk, 4:08pm.
